ar opening at the top that spans hundreds of meters in diameter, revealing a spectacular subterranean world below. The edges of the sinkhole are lined with dense tropical jungle, with towering trees leaning dramatically over the rim, their long roots cascading down into the cavern like living pillars. The sheer scale of the opening allows vast beams of golden sunlight to flood into the cavern, illuminating every corner with a warm, radiant glow.\n\nAt the bottom of the cenote lies a sprawling landscape, with a massive crystal-clear lake surrounded by patches of lush, fertile land. The lake glistens in shades of turquoise and emerald, reflecting the sunlight and the towering rock walls. Around it, small sandy shores and rocky plateaus lead into dense clusters of tropical plants, including towering palms, vibrant flowers, and lush ferns.\n\nThe cavern walls, rising to incredible heights, are dotted with the entrances of numerous caves, some small and mysterious, others large enough to suggest deeper, hidden chambers. The rock walls are alive with texture—cascading vines, moss, and sparkling veins of quartz and minerals catch the sunlight in dazzling patterns.\n\nWaterfalls tumble from the walls high above, pouring into the lake below with a continuous roar, their mist spreading across the cavern and catching the sunlight to create shimmering rainbows. Gigantic stalactites hang from the cavern ceiling, some so massive they resemble natural pillars, while others remain suspended above, creating dramatic shapes against the light.\n\nThe opening at the top dominates the scene, revealing a bright, clear blue sky framed by the greenery of the jungle. Birds with vibrant plumage glide across the open space, their cries echoing faintly. The sunlight streaming down illuminates the lake, the patches of land, and the cavern walls, creating a breathtaking interplay of light and shadow.\n\nThis colossal cenote, with its immense opening and the intricate blend of water, land, and caves, feels like a hidden world on an unimaginable scale, combining vibrant life, geological wonder, and a sense of serene majesty."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1011, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 1000, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"pinned": false, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": {"0": 474.760986328125, "1": 59.253170013427734}, "pos": [-3850, 2990], "id": 98, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [], "size": {"0": 315, "1": 270}, "pos": [-1841.67822265625, 2205.4384765625], "widgets_values": ["upscaled"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1022, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {"pinned": false, "collapsed": false}, "id": 495, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 38}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1021], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE"}], "size": {"0": 315, "1": 314}, "pos": [-1836.991455078125, 2551.689208984375], "widgets_values": ["wavelet", "Preview", "ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "image_ref", "link": 1041, "label": "image_ref", "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "image_target", "link": 1023, "label": "image_target", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {"pinned": false, "collapsed": false}, "id": 496, "type": "easy imageColorMatch", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "easy imageColorMatch"}, "order": 39}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1034], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["(cartoon:0.5)"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1012, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}], "flags": {"pinned": false, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": {"0": 477.8099060058594, "1": 125.56340789794922}, "pos": [-3860, 3150], "id": 100, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIP